{"id":346,"name":"cradily","speciesId":346,"dex":346,"form":"normal","generation":3,"types":["rock","grass"],"stats":{"hp":86,"attack":81,"defense":97,"special-attack":81,"special-defense":107,"speed":43},"abilities":[{"name":"suction-cups","hidden":false},{"name":"storm-drain","hidden":true}],"height":15,"weight":604,"baseExp":173,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/346.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/346.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/346.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/346.ogg","genus":"Barnacle Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Craca","flavor":[{"version":"ruby","text":"CRADILY roams around the ocean floor in search of food. This POKéMON freely extends its tree trunk-like neck and captures unwary prey using its eight tentacles."},{"version":"sapphire","text":"CRADILY’s body serves as an anchor, preventing it from being washed away in rough seas. This POKéMON secretes a strong digestive fluid from its tentacles."},{"version":"emerald","text":"It drags its heavy body along the seafloor. It makes its nest in the shallows of warm seas. CRADILY can be seen on beaches when the tide goes out."},{"version":"firered","text":"It ensnares prey with its eight tentacles. It then melts the prey with a strong acid before feeding."},{"version":"diamond","text":"It lives in the shallows of warm seas. When the tide goes out, it digs up prey from beaches."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"It lives in warm seas. Its heavy body weighs it down so it won’t get washed away in rough weather."},{"version":"omega-ruby","text":"Cradily roams around the ocean floor in search of food. This Pokémon freely extends its tree trunk-like neck and captures unwary prey using its eight tentacles."},{"version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cra